t more team coordination that what is expected. I found the game to be enjoyably hard and for every struggle on a mission my group had to face the more rewarding and deserved it felt once we beat it.\n\nThere are spikes in difficulty in many missions which felt very unnecessary but that adversity and labor only pushed us to go forward and beat the game.\n\nEDF!", "timestamp_created": 1686160625, "timestamp_updated": 1686160625, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.541984736919403076", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "139676129", "author": {"steamid": "76561198087650317", "personaname": "Cannelle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/timetoscrem/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 2967, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2110, "last_played": 1742840975, "avatar": "e5e611efb1672b94d6e6ac7553333ca804f4a6fc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun with-friends experience, give it a shot if you and a few peeps just need to kill some aliens.\n\nYou WILL get PTSD from how scarily human-like the enemies are...", "timestamp_created": 1686122554, "timestamp_updated": 1686122554, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 22, "votes_funny": 6, "weighted_vote_score": "0.720381319522857666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}